{"id": "FL-020-N1", "type": "field_note"}
A technician checked a unit at the north loading bay and saw the status light blink three times. The photograph did not make the full equipment tag readable. The technician has not confirmed an equipment ID or recorded any repair or parts information.

{"id": "FL-020-N2", "type": "simulated_image_description"}
Unreviewed OCR text from the same photograph: "Tag might read P-0?; the last character is illegible." This is an uncertain extraction, not a confirmed identifier.

